# v1 improved: order from the simulator's search (Orc Horde, 2000000 tries, seeded with v1's order;
# 124.5 h -> 116.8 h to 60 in the model), written by polestar apply-route.
# Added here: Cortello's Riddle (626), Dark Heart (3062).
# Left out: A Threat in Feralas (2981), Continued Threat (1428).
# 8 goals moved in from other guides of the chain.
# The notes above describe v1's order; the steps below are the improved one.
# Route from the Polestar route simulator's Horde consensus (Tauren export),
# visits 39-43, levels 44-45.9. Checked by lint, not play-tested on Forever
# yet. Era + known Forever quests only.
#
# Flow: Stonard (where the previous guide ends; bind) -> A Soggy Scroll ->
# Pool of Tears -> the east coast crawlers -> Misty Reed Post and its
# murlocs -> hearth Stonard -> fly Grom'gol -> zeppelin to Orgrimmar
# (training, turn-ins) -> fly Brackenwall Village -> the Wyrmbog ->
# Brackenwall -> Onyxia's eggs -> Brackenwall -> fly Camp Mojache (bind) ->
# sprite darters, forest walkers, Feral Scar Vale and the hippogryphs ->
# Zorbin Fandazzle and the Forgotten Coast -> the Northspring harpies ->
# hearth Camp Mojache -> Rage Scar yetis -> Camp Mojache, where the next
# guide flies on to Gadgetzan.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - Threat From the Sea (1426): the export kills part of the murlocs here,
#   the rest on a Blasted Lands pass at 46.7 (visit 45) and hands it in on a
#   return to Misty Reed Post at 47.7 (visit 51) with its follow-up (1427)
#   and Continued Threat (1428). All three are done here in one sweep of the
#   Misty Reed shore and handed in on the spot: both later trips go away.
# - Thunder Bluff (visit 40) is dropped: a flight there and back for one
#   accept, Deadmire (1205), whose turn-in is back in Thunder Bluff near
#   level 50. With it go the Thunder Bluff bind and the hearth back there.
# - Orgrimmar (visit 42) comes straight off the zeppelin instead of after
#   Dustwallow Marsh; Brackenwall then flies on to Camp Mojache. The
#   Orgrimmar bind is left out (the export replaces it at once).
# - Swamp of Sorrows: one loop out of Stonard (scroll, Pool of Tears, the
#   crawlers, Misty Reed) and the export's hearth back to Stonard.
# - Feralas: the four Natural Materials parts are picked up on the way
#   south-west to Feral Scar Vale and the hippogryphs, before Zorbin's coast.
#
# Class training: Orgrimmar. Druids and Paladins: a side flight to Thunder
# Bluff before Dustwallow Marsh.
#
# Optional: Challenge Overlord Mok'Morokk (1173): Mok'Morokk is elite.
# Perfect Yeti Hide (7738): it starts from a rare drop.
#
# Accepted here, finished later on the route: Cortello's Riddle (625, the
# Musty Scroll in Dustwallow Marsh, here), The Atal'ai Exile (1429,
# Hinterlands), Testing the Vessel (3123: Hinterlands owlbeasts, turned in
# at Camp Mojache around 50), Zukk'ash Report (7732, Orgrimmar around 50).
#
# Left out: Deadmire (1205), see above.

