step The Wyrmbog
  when onquest 625
  tip Ride south-west to the Musty Scroll, then east through the Wyrmbog. The Firemane scouts and ash tails roam its northern edge with the Searing hatchlings and whelps; the scalebanes guard the dragon caves further south-east. Mok'Morokk's snuff, grog and strongbox lie in the dragonkin camps.
  turnin 625                            -- the Musty Scroll

