# ---------------------------------------------------------------- West: screechers and OOX-22/FE

step Rogue Vale screechers
  tip Ride west into the middle of Feralas. Kill a Rogue Vale Screecher, use Yeh'kinya's Bramble on its body and kill the spirit that rises.
  use 10699 "Yeh'kinya's Bramble" @45.0,38.0
  kill 8612 quest 3520.1

step The Forgotten Coast: kill these as you meet them
  zone Feralas
  tip Sea elementals and sea sprays wash along the shore around the dock. Zap the giants with Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker first: shrunken, they lose their elite strength. Shore striders wade in the water; the land walkers and cliff giants roam the hills further north.
  collect 18958 quest 7721.1
  collect 18956 quest 7003.1
  use 18904 quest 7003.1 @40.1,38.6 map 1444

step Ruins of Ravenwind: kill these as you meet them
  zone Feralas
  tip The Northspring harpies nest on the ridges in the far north-west. They are 48-50, a few levels above you: the Windcallers heal, so kill them first and pull one at a time.
  tip Careful: Wait until an earlier Edana's corpse has fully despawned before you blow the horn. If you use it too soon, the horn is lost and Edana does not appear.
  kill 5363 quest 3063.2
  kill 5362 quest 3063.1
  kill 5364 quest 3063.3
  kill 5366 quest 3063.4

step Ruins of Ravenwind: kill these as you meet them
  when group 3062
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Edana Hatetalon is a level 50 elite: most classes solo it at level 52, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.
  collect 9528 quest 3062.1 @40.5,8.6 map 1444

